<title>UK: Williams says buys 4.97 pct in Chubb.</title>
<headline>Williams says buys 4.97 pct in Chubb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Holdings Plc said on Friday that it had bought 14 million shares or 4.97 percent in the ordinary share capital of Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>Williams disclosed this through its broker De Zoete &amp; Bevan Ltd.  The purchases were made by Williams Properties Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Williams Holdings.</p>
<p>Earlier on Friday Williams launched a recommended 1.3 billion stg offer for the security company.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
